/T (The handing-over ceremony of a digital mammogram by the Rotary Club of Madras to the Tiruvannamalai Cancer Education and Screening Center, Cancer Institute \(WIA\), was held on 10 March 2025, in Tiruvannamalai. The facility will benefit an estimate of 2,45,000 eligible women in the district. The Chief Guest, Shri Ganesan S., EVP-Special Projects at SBI Mutual Funds, inaugurated the mammography unit.  This is the second digital mammogram unit sponsored by SBI Mutual Funds and donated through the Rotary Club of Madras. )
