/T (In observance of National No Smoking Day, the Department of Psycho-oncology organized a month-long awareness campaign across schools and communities. Activities included cycle rallies, awareness rallies, dental check-ups, IEC material distribution, and health education sessions focused on the dangers of tobacco and second-hand smoke. Students were educated on the health risks of tobacco, the impact of secondhand smoke, and strategies to resist peer pressure, promoting a tobacco-free school environment.)
